"""E119-R2 framework definitions: existing FIRI v2 review, the proposed indicators, and every E118/E119 dataset.

Data only (no computation). `analyze.py` measures coverage and redundancy from the files and writes the deliverables.
Role vocabulary:
    forecasting_predictor     usable in the regional SWS forecasting model at regional / national resolution (2021+, as-of,
                              enough quarters); where the same table also has provincial rows, those feed the provincial profile
    provincial_profiling      province-level vulnerability profile (quarterly or annual), no supervised label
    regional_context          national / regional value shown beside the profile; never copied to provinces
    supporting_variable       kept in the indicator as an alternative or sensitivity measure (redundant or partial)
    validation_only           an outcome measure used to check, not to train
    excluded                  not used in modeling (reason given)
"""
from __future__ import annotations

